From 45dfb46448a130482e9050664f9d7f7288c0b4b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anish Ramasekar <anish.ramasekar@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Jul 2025 16:51:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add TokenRequestServiceAccountUIDValidation feature gate with
 UID validation

This change introduces the TokenRequestServiceAccountUIDValidation feature
gate and implements feature-gated service account UID validation for the
TokenRequest API. When enabled, the API validates that the service account
UID in token requests matches the actual service account UID, preventing
token requests for recreated service accounts with the same name but
different UIDs.

Signed-off-by: Anish Ramasekar <anish.ramasekar@gmail.com>
---
 pkg/features/kube_features.go                 |   4 +
 .../core/serviceaccount/storage/token.go      |  21 +++
 .../core/serviceaccount/storage/token_test.go | 133 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../apiserver/pkg/features/kube_features.go   |  14 ++
 .../reference/versioned_feature_list.yaml     |   6 +
 test/integration/auth/svcaccttoken_test.go    |  91 ++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 269 insertions(+)

